      {
        "index": 11,
        "name": "That Eerie Feeling",
        "description": "MENU: “The “Eerie” type comes into being when the normal state of things gets changed by something divine or supernatural.”\nMENU: “If you ask me, this entire world is a little bit eerie, but there’s places where that effect is heightened enough for it to be the main influence on the local environment.”\nMENU: “By comparing the items from an eerie room to ones from a normal room, we might be able to chart out how this world has been changed.”\nMENU: “Collect three scavenges from eerie type rooms and let’s see what turns up.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "rewards": [
