      {
        "index": 15,
        "name": "Identifying Materials: Stone",
        "description": "MENU: “Sometimes a rock isn’t just a rock. Sometimes it really “rocks”!”\nMENU: “…”\nMENU: “I’m sorry.”\nMENU: “What I meant to say is: The structure of these rocks doesn’t always make geological sense.”\nMENU: “It’s natural for them to be a little different. The Kamigotchi World doesn’t follow the same laws as the physical world.”\nMENU: “But I want to know exactly how they differ. Collect 5 Rocks so I can run some tests.”",
