      {
        "index": 23,
        "name": "Squaring the Circle III",
        "description": "MENU: “We haven’t gotten answers yet, but we’ve made a little progress. \nMENU: “More information helps. More context helps.”\nMENU: “Even if we don’t find something with a direct connection to the labs, I feel like we’re on the right track.”\nMENU: “Next, visit the Blooming Tree and make scavenging rolls.”\nMENU: “The weather here is always clear. It wasn’t lightning, so what blasted that tree apart?\nMENU: “It probably won’t open any doors for us, but I’m still curious.”",
