        "description": "MENU: “Okay, you might not be able to trip off those little mushrooms, or eat them at all for that matter, but they’re still neat!”\nMINA: “They’re hard and solid, like a dense wood.”\nMINA: “Get a pile of stems and glue them together and you could make some lumber.”",
