        "description": "MENU: “This cute little temple doesn’t lead anywhere else within the cave system, but it might have some good leads for our investigation.”\nMENU: “The machines here are super weird.  And really, really old.”\nMENU: “There’s some modern equipment plugged into it though. Maybe from the labs? It’s in better shape than I’d expect stuff from the scrapyard to be.”\nMENU: “Let me scan the room and see what I can find.”\nMENU: “Do some harvesting in the meantime, it usually helps me think.”",
