        "name": "Sweet As Honey",
        "description": "MENU: “There are glittering candies growing on some of the mushroom stalks in the caves.”\nMENU: “They’ll probably show up in a few other places, too.”\nMENU: “It’s not like Big Rock Candy Mountain, the candy doesn’t just show up on its own.”\nMENU: “The Honeydew Scale is actually a small insect native to dark environments like this cave.”\nMENU: “The candy is like a protective shell that builds up over time on their backs.”\nMENU: “This has nothing to do with my mission to get inside the labs, but it’s really neat!”\nMENU: “Besides, it’s handy that you can find them here. They look like a great natural food source for your Kami.”\nMENU: “Why don’t you find a nice place to relax and let your Kami scavenge some?”\nMENU: “Take in the sights while I try to figure out where we should go next.”",
