        "description": "MENU: “This next part will be a little bit nasty. To be thorough with our survey, we’ll need to check out some insect type rooms.”\nMENU: “The Insect type might make your skin crawl, but it’s not always about seeing bugs.”\nMENU: “It’s deeper than that, it’s an energetic defilement, the kind of thing that makes you feel dirty inside and out.”\nMENU: “You could think of it like a sort of corruption that the insects are drawn to.”\nMENU: “Collect three scavenges from insect type rooms and I’ll compare them to our baseline.”",
