        "description": "MENU: “This could be big! That datachip must have some juicy info on it.”\nMENU: “Maybe it’s a journal or diary from someone important.\nMENU: “Or a book on this crazy tech that I could use to upgrade myself.”\nMENU: “This could be the breakthrough I’m looking for!”\nMENU: “Quick, connect that datachip to the old laptop and I’ll see what I can pull off of it.”",
