        "description": "MINA: “I suppose I can spare some information for you.”\nMINA: “Observe the walls of these caves. It should be apparent that while some of them are natural, others were built by human hands.”\nMINA: “See how the large blocks of stone are smooth cut and fit together like the pieces of a puzzle?”\nMINA: “It appears almost natural, but shows the great skill of the master craftsman.”\nMINA: “You should have all the ingredients you need to practice this form of craft yourself.”\nMINA: “It's a bit old fashioned, but it’s strong and long lasting.”",
